      "num_turns": 17,
      "result": "Implemented the PostgreSQL-backed URL shortener. It supports link creation, lookup, listing, redirects with atomic click tracking, duplicate-code conflicts, and validation errors. The service creates its database schema on startup and listens on `0.0.0.0:8000`.\n\nRun it with `sh start.sh` after setting `DATABASE_URL`. Startup instructions are in the README.\n\nVerified with `go test ./...`, `go vet ./...`, and live HTTP checks for creation, duplicate codes, redirect/click counting, and invalid URLs. The server was stopped after testing.",
